flowchart TD
  R[Request] --> F[Servlet filters<br/>security · logging]
  F --> C[DispatcherServlet →<br/>controller → service]
  C -- throws --> H{"@RestControllerAdvice<br/>handler matches?"}
  H -- yes --> P[ProblemDetail<br/>status · type · detail]
  H -- no --> E["/error → BasicErrorController"]
  F -- "throws" --> E
  F -. "auth failures" .-> S[Spring Security<br/>401 / 403 entry points]
  A["@Async / @Scheduled thread"] -- throws --> U[Async handler / logs<br/>never reaches the client]
